{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2014-06", "window": 1, "start_date": 1401580800, "end_date": 1402185599, "month_true_total": 1166, "quota": 11, "returned": 11, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:08:32 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "10384777", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024957289", "personaname": "trem", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/fizband89/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 177, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 54, "last_played": 1462259758, "avatar": "37c72f26869420ab9fc718738ed41809c90d1f81"}, "language": "english", "review": "Dark Souls has got nothing on this game.  Be ready for a challenge.", "timestamp_created": 1402167759, "timestamp_updated": 1402167759, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.590289711952209473", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "10384172", "author": {"steamid": "76561198048943495", "personaname": "Punished Goose", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198048943495/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 1052, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 936, "last_played": 1420307736, "avatar": "afffdf9168a9f9c87f5659ab7a52ef47759eac51"}, "language": "english", "review": "Temple of the Elders teleporter.\n\nAccidentally selected return to first level.\n\n10/10 would select again.", "timestamp_created": 1402164646, "timestamp_updated": 1402164646, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.542302370071411133", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "10384045", "author": {"steamid": "76561198051921041", "personaname": "McEgg", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ProperRooster/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1722, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1420, "last_played": 1554597765, "avatar": "756f02cf9a864c52adc53d2341f9f16c82bbcea8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really enjoy this game, especially when you have someone with whom you can play it!", "timestamp_created": 1402163989, "timestamp_updated": 1402163989, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "10383508", "author": {"steamid": "76561198008637885", "personaname": "kfshradio", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kfshradio/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 5777, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1883, "last_played": 1497503341, "avatar": "4f13dc451264ad5b60800afce66d1349a3c6469b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Risk of Rain. A game that prides itself on being insanely difficult. Right off the bat, a red flag. But! RoR is easy to pick up, with a small set of skills that must be executed flawlessly in order to beat the game (unless you are playing Huntress. Huntress OP).\n\nThe game's selling points are perma-death (new term for \"arcade\") and its rougelike elements. Drops and enemies are randomized, while the ten possible maps are stitched together out of pre-determined chunks. It has a degree of arbitration while retaining familiarity to those who repeatedly play the game. A nice balance.\n\nThe game is one of the best examples of modern pixel art that I can think of on the top of my head. It's really pretty. The movement is also very polished, with no little kinks as to how you are supposed to execute attacks--the ones you would find in games like CS:GO and Dark Souls.\n\nWhat's better yet is the game has multiplayer! PvE. But, this is where the shortcomings of the game begin. Multiple players are forced to fight over a fixed amount of item drops, which either requires a lot of teamwork, or having one person be the ♥♥♥♥♥ of the team who is insta-gibbed at the beginning of each stage because his teammates stole all the upgrades. While this allows for some strategy, a necessary part of good multiplayer, the scaling is just too unforgiving. Multiplayer makes the hardest difficulty look like child's play. \n\nThe class balance is also a little wonky. Some classes are very easy to pick up (Huntress, Soldier, HAN-D), while others require ludicrous amounts of skill. Making some classes more difficult while others less so would make the game much better to play.\n\nBottom line: If you are looking for an easy-to-play, hard-to-master game with decent multiplayer capability, get this game.\n\n8/10", "timestamp_created": 1402161011, "timestamp_updated": 1402161011, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.540663242340087891", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "10380187", "author": {"steamid": "76561198008022329", "personaname": "Kygrot", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Kygrot/", "num_games_owned": 1029, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 1225, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1087, "last_played": 1443654918, "avatar": "97b36634e48c8bfeca360729793ed4712282e027"}, "language": "english", "review": "